<title>UK: Bco Nordeste sets $50 mln bond.</title>
<headline>Bco Nordeste sets $50 mln bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager CSFB.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANCO NORDESTE DO BRAZIL SA</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     **	  MATURITY   *07.MAR.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+337.5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p>	     *CALL AND PUT OPTION 07.MAR.02</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP/BR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  BRAZIL    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  0.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FIVE-YEAR US TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
